1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:09,717
gCaptain reports that as many as 70 ships are waiting near the Danube’s Sulina Canal to reach Ukrainian ports and load grain.

2
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:15,711
Traders and analysts blamed a shortage of pilots and priority for other cargoes.

3
00:00:15,711 --> 00:00:23,123
The delays show how Black Sea risks and river bottlenecks can still affect food exports and freight planning.

